.TH "kmscon-launch-gui" "1" "2026-02-09" "KMSCON"
.SH "NAME"
kmscon-launch-gui \- Launch graphical sessions from kmscon TTY session
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.SY kmscon-launch-gui
.RI [ argument \~.\|.\|.\&]
.YS
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.B kmscon-launch-gui
can be used to launch graphical sessions from within kmscon TTY sessions.
.P
For example, instead of calling:
.P
.in +4n
.EX
.RB $ " startx"
.EE
.in
.P
The user should use the following command instead within kmscon-enabled TTY:
.P
.in +4n
.EX
.RB $ " kmscon-launch-gui startx"
.EE
.in
.SH "BUGS"
.B kmscon-launch-gui
may have bugs. Please report any bugs you encountered back to kmscon upstream.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR kmscon (1)
